module

public import Mathlib.Tactic

/-!
# Tables for the minecart model

Generated by `tests/palettes/minecart-tables.py` from the block dump of the 26.3 server; do
not edit. The tables are:

* the boxes of every shape of the dump's shape table (`Attrs.collision` and `Attrs.outline`
  are indices into it), as the raw bits of their `double` coordinates;
* the grid planes of every collision shape (`VoxelShape.getCoords`), which the boxes do not
  determine and on which `VoxelShape.collide` works;
* the two tables of `Mth.atan2`;
* the items whose maximum stack size is not 64.

The shape table is not particular to minecarts and should move to the block inventory once
another component needs it.
-/

set_option linter.style.longLine false

@[expose] public section

